WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.844 --> 00:00:15.168
"Stop!" Roxy cried as an alien stomped toward her.

2
00:00:15.688 --> 00:00:18.469
All the fighters were in the stadium, having an enormous battle.

3
00:00:18.489 --> 00:00:19.849
"No way!

4
00:00:20.169 --> 00:00:22.530
I want that golden asteroid!"

5
00:00:23.070 --> 00:00:26.251
The alien swung a wooden club, which Roxy easily dodged.

6
00:00:26.271 --> 00:00:29.432
"This is ridiculous," Roxy said.

7
00:00:29.976 --> 00:00:33.037
"We should all fight the Battle Master—not each other!"

8
00:00:33.057 --> 00:00:36.419
"Grr!" The alien swung his club again.

9
00:00:36.919 --> 00:00:39.340
Roxy stepped to the side and then stared at the club.

10
00:00:40.020 --> 00:00:43.902
Orange beams radiated from her eyes until the club burst into flames.

11
00:00:43.922 --> 00:00:47.243
"Yikes!" The alien dropped the club.

12
00:00:47.663 --> 00:00:51.665
Roxy darted away and found Cozlin, who was also trying to avoid the fight.

13
00:00:51.685 --> 00:00:56.267
"This is terrible," Roxy said.

14
00:00:56.807 --> 00:00:57.567
Cozlin nodded.

15
00:00:57.587 --> 00:01:00.649
"I agree—we have to get out of here.

16
00:01:01.109 --> 00:01:02.089
Where's Wukong?"

17
00:01:03.530 --> 00:01:05.271
"Ahh!" Nebulon darted past.

18
00:01:06.011 --> 00:01:09.132
A big crab was chasing the warrior, snapping its claws at his feet.

19
00:01:09.852 --> 00:01:11.293
The crab stopped and looked at them.

20
00:01:11.893 --> 00:01:14.334
Light sparkled, and the crab turned into Wukong.

21
00:01:14.674 --> 00:01:15.235
He laughed.

22
00:01:16.055 --> 00:01:17.596
"This is fun!"

23
00:01:18.336 --> 00:01:19.436
Roxy rolled her eyes.

24
00:01:19.456 --> 00:01:21.377
"We need to get out of here."

25
00:01:22.117 --> 00:01:23.018
Wukong sighed.

26
00:01:23.038 --> 00:01:24.779
"I know.

27
00:01:25.199 --> 00:01:26.459
Maybe Sapphire can help us."

28
00:01:26.479 --> 00:01:28.000
"Where is she?"

29
00:01:28.456 --> 00:01:29.416
Roxy looked around.

30
00:01:29.776 --> 00:01:31.077
Cozlin pointed and laughed.

31
00:01:31.097 --> 00:01:32.577
"Over there!"

32
00:01:33.177 --> 00:01:36.358
Roxy and Wukong looked over and saw the big dragon fast asleep.

33
00:01:37.879 --> 00:01:39.439
Suddenly a deep voice boomed.

34
00:01:39.459 --> 00:01:42.600
"The golden asteroid is mine!"

35
00:01:43.080 --> 00:01:46.041
They looked up and saw a gorilla with wings standing on the asteroid.

36
00:01:46.901 --> 00:01:49.502
The slug flew up to it and knocked off the gorilla.

37
00:01:50.262 --> 00:01:51.122
The slug laughed.

38
00:01:51.142 --> 00:01:52.943
"Now it's mine!"

39
00:01:52.963 --> 00:01:54.763
"Not for long!"

40
00:01:55.863 --> 00:01:57.504
Volgren leaped up to the platform.

41
00:01:57.948 --> 00:02:01.650
One of her tentacles grabbed the edge, throwing the entire platform off balance.

42
00:02:01.670 --> 00:02:06.512
"Waa!" The slug fell off—and so did the asteroid!

43
00:02:07.252 --> 00:02:08.712
It hit the ground with a thud.

44
00:02:09.133 --> 00:02:11.053
Right away, fighters clambered over to it.

45
00:02:11.073 --> 00:02:12.894
"It's mine!"

46
00:02:12.914 --> 00:02:15.435
"No way—I got to it first!"

47
00:02:16.416 --> 00:02:18.516
Roxy heard heavy footsteps and spun around.

48
00:02:19.057 --> 00:02:20.897
A big robot was running toward her.

49
00:02:21.518 --> 00:02:22.878
Roxy's eyes went wide.

50
00:02:22.898 --> 00:02:27.000
"Terrell?" Then she saw a small, flying robot and smiled.

51
00:02:27.436 --> 00:02:30.078
"Bippo!" "Hero, me!"

52
00:02:30.758 --> 00:02:33.520
The big robot's head opened, and Terrell grinned.

53
00:02:34.060 --> 00:02:35.961
"Dr. Odd got the force field down!

54
00:02:36.401 --> 00:02:37.782
Let's get out of—" Bam!

55
00:02:38.122 --> 00:02:39.443
A green monster knocked him over.

56
00:02:39.463 --> 00:02:42.445
"Mean, you!"

57
00:02:42.945 --> 00:02:44.786
Bippo fired his laser at the monster.

58
00:02:45.266 --> 00:02:49.969
Pew! Terrell jumped back to his feet and closed the robot's head.

59
00:02:50.869 --> 00:02:54.151
When a large alien jumped toward him, he swung his big fist.

60
00:02:54.791 --> 00:02:57.505
Pow! The alien tumbled backward.

61
00:02:58.506 --> 00:02:59.587
Roxy had had enough.

62
00:02:59.607 --> 00:03:02.489
"Everyone, stop fighting!"

63
00:03:02.870 --> 00:03:04.311
she yelled, but nobody listened.

64
00:03:05.352 --> 00:03:05.932
She sighed.

65
00:03:06.733 --> 00:03:09.215
Then she noticed brown specks on the asteroid.

66
00:03:09.755 --> 00:03:11.316
She looked closely and gasped.

67
00:03:11.997 --> 00:03:13.538
"Those aren't specks!"

68
00:03:14.239 --> 00:03:15.720
She fired her eye laser beams.

69
00:03:16.220 --> 00:03:20.304
Whiz-hoo! The asteroid exploded into several pieces.

70
00:03:20.764 --> 00:03:23.306
The inside wasn't gold at all—it was brown.

71
00:03:23.326 --> 00:03:25.588
"Aha!" Roxy said.

72
00:03:26.016 --> 00:03:27.697
"It's not a golden asteroid!

73
00:03:27.998 --> 00:03:29.419
It was just painted gold!"

74
00:03:29.999 --> 00:03:30.920
The fighting stopped.

75
00:03:31.420 --> 00:03:32.441
The slug frowned.

76
00:03:32.461 --> 00:03:33.922
"It's a fake?"

77
00:03:33.942 --> 00:03:37.745
"Where's the Battle Master?"

78
00:03:38.105 --> 00:03:38.926
Kothar asked.

79
00:03:38.946 --> 00:03:41.267
"He has some explaining to do!"

80
00:03:42.168 --> 00:03:43.669
Audience members began to murmur.

81
00:03:43.689 --> 00:03:46.311
"The asteroid is fake!"

82
00:03:46.731 --> 00:03:48.953
"The Battle Master is a fraud!"

83
00:03:49.614 --> 00:03:52.636
Roxy looked around and saw the Battle Master up on his platform.

84
00:03:53.228 --> 00:03:56.134
He pressed a button, and the platform shot toward an exit.

85
00:03:56.896 --> 00:03:58.619
The Battle Master jumped off and ran!
